message: "If you use this code or data, please cite as below."
type: software
title: "CASPER Simulation — Reproducibility Package"
abstract: >
  Simulation code and data for the preprint 'CASPER: A Simulation-Validated
  Design Study of Semantic Dynamic-Object Filtering for LiDAR Odometry in
  Industrial Warehouse Environments'. Preprint; not peer reviewed.
  CASPER is a proposed architecture; the full LIO-SAM + RandLA-Net integration
  was not implemented. Results validate the class-conditioned exclusion
  principle only.
